apping Atlas corpus records (logical files, immutable versions, chunks/occurrences, ingest runs with attestations) and PROV-lite provenance/lineage relations into existing ID-graph objects.\n\nKey decisions:\n- D1: canonical in Atlas tables; ID graph is a projection (re-projection rebuild).\n- D2-D5: versions to document.put, logical files to note.create/revise chains, occurrences as tag claims (heads full, history by reference), ingest batches as one attestation.claim per batch digest.\n- D6: PROV-lite relations as atlas.* namespaced tag.set claims with fixed directionality; note.link explicitly not the carrier.\n- Consumes #3125 occurrence semantics and the landed #5545 writer-set projection (PR #6672) without redefining either; takes #6022 placement as input without selecting note classes.\n- Replay/correction/retention/consistency rules (§6), projection versioning (§7), open items with stated defaults (§8).\n\nDesign-only; no implementation. Follow-ons in §9.\n\nAcceptance audit in Appendix A; cross-reference audit in Appendix B.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796800943&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7998&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7998&signature=c39d383debae3f1f8d9dbce3a9eb2732fac78d9d62098522ad27ea9365a543fc\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7998?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_p